tle":"Warum Dateiformatkompatibilität immer noch alles kaputt macht","excerpt":"Man sollte meinen, HEIC in JPG umwandeln wäre längst gelöst. Ist es nicht. Aber es muss nicht wehtun.","category":"tools","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558494949-ef010cbdcc31?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Digitale Dateien und Formatsymbole auf einem Bildschirm","publishedAt":"2026-03-23","readingTime":4},{"slug":"filetools-format-compatibility-en","lang":"en","title":"Why File Format Compatibility Still Breaks Everything","excerpt":"You'd think converting a HEIC to JPG would be solved by now. It's not. But it doesn't have to be painful.","category":"tools","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558494949-ef010cbdcc31?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Digital files and format icons on a screen","publishedAt":"2026-03-23","readingTime":4},{"slug":"filetools-format-compatibility-es","lang":"es","title":"Por qué la compatibilidad de formatos de archivo sigue rompiéndolo todo","excerpt":"Uno pensaría que convertir HEIC a JPG ya estaría resuelto. No lo está. Pero no tiene que ser doloroso.","category":"tools","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558494949-ef010cbdcc31?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Archivos digitales e iconos de formatos en una pantalla","publishedAt":"2026-03-23","readingTime":4},{"slug":"filetools-format-compatibility-fr","lang":"fr","title":"Pourquoi la compatibilité des formats de fichiers casse encore tout","excerpt":"On pourrait croire que convertir un HEIC en JPG est un problème résolu. Non. Mais ça n'a pas besoin d'être compliqué.","category":"tools","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558494949-ef010cbdcc31?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Fichiers numériques et icônes de formats sur un écran","publishedAt":"2026-03-23","readingTime":4},{"slug":"filetools-format-compatibility-pl","lang":"pl","title":"Dlaczego kompatybilność formatów plików wciąż psuje wszystko","excerpt":"Można by pomyśleć, że konwersja HEIC na JPG to rozwiązany problem. Nie jest. Ale nie musi boleć.","category":"tools","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558494949-ef010cbdcc31?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Pliki cyfrowe i ikony formatów na ekranie","publishedAt":"2026-03-23","readingTime":4},{"slug":"filetools-format-compatibility-zh","lang":"zh","title":"为什么文件格式兼容性仍然搞砸一切","excerpt":"你以为把 HEIC 转成 JPG 早就不是问题了。并没有。但也不必那么痛苦。","category":"tools","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558494949-ef010cbdcc31?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"屏幕上的数字文件和格式图标","publishedAt":"2026-03-23","readingTime":4},{"slug":"roomflip-color-psychology","lang":"cs","title":"Psychologie barev v interiéru: přestaňte hádat a začněte testovat","excerpt":"Ta béžová stěna není 'bezpečná.' Je nudná. Tady je návod, jak vybrat barvy, které opravdu změní atmosféru místnosti.","category":"creative","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1586023492125-27b2c045efd7?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Interiér pokoje s odvážnými barevnými stěnami a moderním nábytkem","publishedAt":"2026-03-23","readingTime":4},{"slug":"roomflip-color-psychology","lang":"de","title":"Farbpsychologie im Interior Design: Schluss mit Raten, anfangen zu testen","excerpt":"Die beige Wand ist nicht 'sicher.' Sie ist langweilig. So wählst du Farben, die wirklich verändern, wie ein Raum sich anfühlt.","category":"creative","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1586023492125-27b2c045efd7?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Rauminterieur mit kräftigen bunten Wänden und modernen Möbeln","publishedAt":"2026-03-23","readingTime":4},{"slug":"roomflip-color-psychology","lang":"en","title":"Color Psychology in Interior Design: Stop Guessing, Start Testing","excerpt":"That beige wall isn't 'safe.' It's boring. Here's how to pick colors that actually change how a room feels.","category":"creative","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1586023492125-27b2c045efd7?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Room interior with bold colorful walls and modern furniture","publishedAt":"2026-03-23","readingTime":4},{"slug":"roomflip-color-psychology","lang":"es","title":"Psicología del color en diseño de interiores: deja de adivinar y empieza a probar","excerpt":"Esa pared beige no es 'segura.' Es aburrida. Así se eligen colores que realmente cambian cómo se siente una habitación.","category":"creative","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1586023492125-27b2c045efd7?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Interior de habitación con paredes de colores atrevidos y muebles modernos","publishedAt":"2026-03-23","readingTime":4},{"slug":"roomflip-color-psychology","lang":"fr","title":"Psychologie des couleurs en décoration : arrêtez de deviner, commencez à tester","excerpt":"Ce mur beige n'est pas 'prudent.' Il est ennuyeux. Voici comment choisir des couleurs qui changent vraiment l'atmosphère.","category":"creative","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1586023492125-27b2c045efd7?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Intérieur avec des murs colorés audacieux et du mobilier moderne","publishedAt":"2026-03-23","readingTime":4},{"slug":"roomflip-color-psychology","lang":"pl","title":"Psychologia koloru w aranżacji wnętrz: przestań zgadywać, zacznij testować","excerpt":"Ta beżowa ściana nie jest 'bezpieczna.' Jest nudna. Oto jak wybrać kolory, które naprawdę zmieniają atmosferę pomieszczenia.","category":"creative","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1586023492125-27b2c045efd7?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Wnętrze pokoju z odważnymi kolorowymi ścianami i nowoczesnymi meblami","publishedAt":"2026-03-23","readingTime":4},{"slug":"roomflip-color-psychology","lang":"zh","title":"室内设计中的色彩心理学：别再猜了，开始测试吧","excerpt":"那面米色墙壁不是'安全'的选择，是无聊的选择。教你挑选真正能改变房间氛围的颜色。","category":"creative","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1586023492125-27b2c045efd7?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"大胆彩色墙壁和现代家具的房间内部","publishedAt":"2026-03-23","readingTime":4},{"slug":"roomflip-rental-staging","lang":"cs","title":"Jak pronajímatelé pomocí AI stylují fotky bytů, aniž by pohnuli jedinou židlí","excerpt":"Prázdné pokoje zabíjejí inzeráty. RoomFlip to spraví za 30 sekund.","category":"creative","ima