estás dejando escapar","excerpt":"Tu canal solo en español deja dinero sobre la mesa. Así cambia el doblaje la ecuación.","category":"ai","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611162617474-5b21e879e113?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Persona grabando contenido de video con micrófono profesional","publishedAt":"2026-03-22","readingTime":4},{"slug":"tubevoice-global-revenue-fr","lang":"fr","title":"Comment les vidéos doublées débloquent des revenus que vous laissez filer","excerpt":"Votre chaîne uniquement en français laisse de l'argent sur la table. Voici comment le doublage change la donne.","category":"ai","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611162617474-5b21e879e113?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Personne enregistrant du contenu vidéo avec un microphone professionnel","publishedAt":"2026-03-22","readingTime":4},{"slug":"tubevoice-global-revenue-pl","lang":"pl","title":"Jak dubbingowane filmy odblokowują przychody, które tracisz","excerpt":"Twój kanał tylko po polsku zostawia pieniądze na stole. Oto jak dubbing zmienia równanie.","category":"ai","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611162617474-5b21e879e113?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Osoba nagrywająca treści wideo z profesjonalnym mikrofonem","publishedAt":"2026-03-22","readingTime":4},{"slug":"tubevoice-global-revenue-zh","lang":"zh","title":"配音视频如何释放你正在错失的收入","excerpt":"你的单语频道正在浪费钱。配音如何改变这个等式。","category":"ai","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611162617474-5b21e879e113?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"使用专业麦克风录制视频内容的人","publishedAt":"2026-03-22","readingTime":4},{"slug":"filetools-privacy-local-conversion-cs","lang":"cs","title":"Vaše soubory nemusí opouštět počítač, aby se zkonvertovaly","excerpt":"Konverze souborů neznamená, že musíte své dokumenty svěřit cizímu serveru.","category":"tools","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1563986768609-322da13575f2?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Zamčený visací zámek na klávesnici notebooku symbolizující ochranu souborů","publishedAt":"2026-03-21","readingTime":4},{"slug":"filetools-privacy-local-conversion-de","lang":"de","title":"Ihre Dateien müssen Ihren Rechner nicht verlassen, um konvertiert zu werden","excerpt":"Dateikonvertierung heißt nicht, dass Ihre Dokumente auf fremden Servern landen müssen.","category":"tools","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1563986768609-322da13575f2?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Verschlossenes Vorhängeschloss auf einer Laptoptastatur als Symbol für Dateischutz","publishedAt":"2026-03-21","readingTime":4},{"slug":"filetools-privacy-local-conversion-en","lang":"en","title":"Your Files Don't Need to Leave Your Computer to Get Converted","excerpt":"File conversion doesn't have to mean handing your documents to a stranger's server.","category":"tools","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1563986768609-322da13575f2?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Locked padlock on a laptop keyboard symbolizing file privacy","publishedAt":"2026-03-21","readingTime":4},{"slug":"filetools-privacy-local-conversion-es","lang":"es","title":"Tus archivos no necesitan salir de tu ordenador para convertirse","excerpt":"Convertir archivos no debería significar entregar tus documentos a un servidor desconocido.","category":"tools","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1563986768609-322da13575f2?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Candado cerrado en un teclado de portátil que simboliza la privacidad de archivos","publishedAt":"2026-03-21","readingTime":4},{"slug":"filetools-privacy-local-conversion-fr","lang":"fr","title":"Vos fichiers n'ont pas besoin de quitter votre ordinateur pour être convertis","excerpt":"Convertir un fichier ne devrait pas impliquer de confier vos documents à un serveur inconnu.","category":"tools","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1563986768609-322da13575f2?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Cadenas verrouillé sur un clavier d'ordinateur symbolisant la confidentialité des fichiers","publishedAt":"2026-03-21","readingTime":4},{"slug":"filetools-privacy-local-conversion-pl","lang":"pl","title":"Twoje pliki nie muszą opuszczać komputera, żeby zostać skonwertowane","excerpt":"Konwersja plików nie powinna oznaczać oddawania dokumentów obcemu serwerowi.","category":"tools","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1563986768609-322da13575f2?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Zamknięta kłódka na klawiaturze laptopa symbolizująca prywatność plików","publishedAt":"2026-03-21","readingTime":4},{"slug":"filetools-privacy-local-conversion-zh","lang":"zh","title":"转换文件不需要把它们上传到别人的服务器","excerpt":"文件转换不应该意味着把你的文档交给陌生的服务器。","category":"tools","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1563986768609-322da13575f2?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"笔记本键盘上的锁头象征文件隐私保护","publishedAt":"2026-03-21","readingTime":4},{"slug":"tubevoice-dubbing-vs-subtitles-cs","lang":"cs","title":"Dabing vs titulky: proč přeložený zvuk vyhrává na YouTube","excerpt":"Titulky jsou práce navíc. Dabované video působí přirozeně. Čísla to potvrzují.","category":"ai","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611162617213-7d7a39e9b1d7?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Osoba nahrávající video s profesionálním mikrofonem","publishedAt":"2026-03-21","readingTime":4},{"slug":"tubevoice-dubbing-vs-subtitles-de","lang":"de","title":"Synchronisation vs Untertitel: Warum übersetzte Audios auf YouTube gewinnen","excerpt":"Untertitel fühlen sich nach Arbeit an. Synchronisierte Videos wirken natürlich. Die Zahlen sprechen für sich.","category":"ai","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611162617213-7d7a39e9b1d7?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Person nimmt Video mit professionellem Mikrofon-Setup auf","publishedAt":"2026-03-21","readingTime":4},{"slug":"tubevoice-dubbing-vs-subtitles-en","lang":"en","title":"Dubbing vs subtitles: why translated audio wins on YouTube","excerpt":"Subtitles feel like homework. Dubbed videos feel native. The retention numbers prove it.","category":"ai","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611162617213-7d7a39e9b1d7?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Person recording video with professional microphone setup","publishedAt":"2026-03-21","readingTime":4},{"slug":"tubevoice-dubbing-vs-subtitles-es","lang":"es","title":"Doblaje vs subtítulos: por qué el audio traducido gana en YouTube","excerpt":"Los subtítulos son trabajo extra para el espectador. Un video doblado suena natural. Los números lo demuestran.","category":"ai","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611162617213-7d7a39e9b1d7?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Persona grabando video con micrófono profesional","publishedAt":"2026-03-21","readingTime":4},{"slug":"tubevoice-dubbing-vs-subtitles-fr","lang":"fr","title":"Doublage vs sous-titres : pourquoi l'audio traduit gagne sur YouTube","excerpt":"Les sous-titres, c'est du travail pour le spectateur. Un doublage, ça sonne naturel. Les chiffres le prouvent.","category":"ai","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611162617213-7d7a39e9b1d7?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Personne enregistrant une vidéo avec un micro professionnel","publishedAt":"2026-03-21","readingTime":4},{"slug":"tubevoice-dubbing-vs-subtitles-pl","lang":"pl","title":"Dubbing vs napisy: dlaczego przetłumaczony dźwięk wygrywa na YouTube","excerpt":"Napisy to praca dla widza. Dubbingowane wideo brzmi naturalnie. Liczby to potwierdzają.","category":"ai","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611162617213-7d7a39e9b1d7?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Osoba nagrywająca wideo z profesjonalnym mikrofonem","publishedAt":"2026-03-21","readingTime":4},{"slug":"tubevoice-dubbing-vs-subtitles-zh","lang":"zh","title":"配音 vs 字幕：为什么翻译音频在YouTube上更胜一筹","excerpt":"字幕是额外负担。配音视频听起来自然。数据证明了这一点。","category":"ai","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611162617213-7d7a39e9b1d7?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"使用专业麦克风录制视频的人","publishedAt":"2026-03-21","readingTime":4},{"slug":"filetools-batch-convert-cs","lang":"cs","title":"Přestaňte konvertovat soubory jeden po druhém. Jde to líp.","excerpt":"Přetahovat soubory do konvertoru jeden po druhém je ztráta času. Hromadná konverze to řeší.","category":"tools","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558494949-ef010cbdcc31?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Ikony různých formátů souborů na digitálním pracovním stole","publishedAt":"2026-03-20","readingTime":4},{"slug":"filetools-batch-convert-de","lang":"de","title":"Hören Sie auf, Dateien einzeln zu konvertieren. Es geht besser.","excerpt":"Dateien einzeln in einen Konverter zu ziehen ist Zeitverschwendung. Stapelkonvertierung löst das.","category":"tools","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558494949-ef010cbdcc31?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Verschiedene Dateiformatsymbole auf einem digitalen Arbeitsplatz","publishedAt":"2026-03-20","readingTime":4},{"slug":"filetools-batch-convert-en","lang":"en","title":"Stop Converting Files One by One. There's a Better Way.","excerpt":"Dragging files one at a time into a converter is a productivity killer. Batch conversion fixes that.","category":"tools","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558494949-ef010cbdcc31?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Multiple file format icons on a digital workspace","publishedAt":"2026-03-20","readingTime":4},{"slug":"filetools-batch-convert-es","lang":"es","title":"Deja de convertir archivos uno por uno. Hay una forma mejor.","excerpt":"Arrastrar archivos de uno en uno a un convertidor mata la productividad. La conversión por lotes lo soluciona.","category":"tools","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558494949-ef010cbdcc31?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Iconos de formatos de archivo en un espacio de trabajo digital","publishedAt":"2026-03-20","readingTime":4},{"slug":"filetools-batch-convert-fr","lang":"fr","title":"Arrêtez de convertir vos fichiers un par un. Il y a mieux.","excerpt":"Glisser des fichiers un par un dans un convertisseur tue la productivité. La conversion par lot règle ça.","category":"tools","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558494949-ef010cbdcc31?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Icônes de formats de fichiers sur un espace de travail numérique","publishedAt":"2026-03-20","readingTime":4},{"slug":"filetools-batch-convert-pl","lang":"pl","title":"Przestań konwertować pliki jeden po drugim. Jest lepszy sposób.","excerpt":"Przeciąganie plików pojedynczo do konwertera to strata czasu. Konwersja wsadowa to rozwiązuje.","category":"tools","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558494949-ef010cbdcc31?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Ikony formatów plików na cyfrowym pulpicie","publishedAt":"2026-03-20","readingTime":4},{"slug":"filetools-batch-convert-zh","lang":"zh","title":"别再一个一个转换文件了，有更好的办法。","excerpt":"把文件一个个拖进转换器是在浪费时间。批量转换才是正解。","category":"tools","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558494949-ef010cbdcc31?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"数字工作台上的多种文件格式图标","publishedAt":"2026-03-20","readingTime":4},{"slug":"roomflip-before-after-cs","lang":"cs","title":"5 pokojů, které jsme předělali s AI — upřímné výsledky před a po","excerpt":"AI interiérový design zní skvěle. Otestovali jsme ho na 5 skutečných pokojích.","category":"creative","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618221195710-dd6b41faaea6?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Obývací pokoj před a po AI redesignu","publishedAt":"2026-03-20","readingTime":4},{"slug":"roomflip-before-after-de","lang":"de","title":"5 Räume mit KI umgestaltet — ehrliche Vorher-Nachher-Ergebnisse","excerpt":"KI-Innendesign klingt gut. Wir haben es an 5 echten Räumen getestet.","category":"creative","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618221195710-dd6b41faaea6?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Wohnzimmer vor und nach KI-Umgestaltung","publishedAt":"2026-03-20","readingTime":4},{"slug":"roomflip-before-after-en","lang":"en","title":"5 rooms we redesigned with AI — honest before & after results","excerpt":"AI interior design sounds great in theory. We tested it on 5 actual rooms to see if the results hold up.","category":"creative","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618221195710-dd6b41faaea6?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Living room before and after AI redesign","publishedAt":"2026-03-20","readingTime":4},{"slug":"roomflip-before-after-es","lang":"es","title":"5 habitaciones rediseñadas con IA — resultados honestos del antes y después","excerpt":"El diseño de interiores con IA suena genial. Lo probamos en 5 habitaciones reales.","category":"creative","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618221195710-dd6b41faaea6?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Salón antes y después del rediseño con IA","publishedAt":"2026-03-20","readingTime":4},{"slug":"roomflip-before-after-fr","lang":"fr","title":"5 pièces relookées par l'IA — résultats avant/après sans filtre","excerpt":"Le design d'intérieur par IA, ça donne quoi concrètement ? Test sur 5 pièces.","category":"creative","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618221195710-dd6b41faaea6?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Salon avant et après relooking par IA","publishedAt":"2026-03-20","readingTime":4},{"slug":"roomflip-before-after-pl","lang":"pl","title":"5 pokoi przeprojektowanych przez AI — szczere wyniki przed i po","excerpt":"AI projektowanie wnętrz brzmi świetnie. Przetestowaliśmy je na 5 prawdziwych pokojach.","category":"creative","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618221195710-dd6b41faaea6?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Salon przed i po zmianie z AI","publishedAt":"2026-03-20","readingTime":4},{"slug":"roomflip-before-after-zh","lang":"zh","title":"用AI重新设计了5个房间——真实的改造前后对比","excerpt":"AI室内设计听起来不错。我们在5个真实房间上做了测试。","category":"creative","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618221195710-dd6b41faaea6?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"客厅AI改造前后对比","publishedAt":"2026-03-20","readingTime":4},{"slug":"filetools-review-cs","lang":"cs","title":"FileTools.eu — bezplatná konverze souborů, která funguje","excerpt":"Přehledný nástroj na konverzi souborů bez otravných reklam. PDF, obrázky, dokumenty — vše online bez registrace.","category":"tools","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517694712202-14dd9538aa97?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Code on laptop screen","publishedAt":"2026-03-19T08:00:00Z","readingTime":3},{"slug":"filetools-review-de","lang":"de","title":"FileTools.eu — kostenlose Dateikonvertierung die funktioniert","excerpt":"Ein sauberes Dateikonvertierungstool ohne Werbe-Überflutung. PDF, Bilder, Dokumente — alles online ohne Registrierung.","category":"tools","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1454165804606-c3d57bc86b40?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Business workspace with papers","publishedAt":"2026-03-19T08:00:00Z","readingTime":3},{"slug":"filetools-review-en","lang":"en","title":"FileTools.eu — free online file conversion that actually works","excerpt":"A clean, ad-light file conversion tool that handles PDFs, images, documents, and more. No account needed, no file size tricks.","category":"tools","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544396821-4dd40b938ad3?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Laptop with documents open","publishedAt":"2026-03-19T08:00:00Z","readingTime":3},{"slug":"filetools-review-es","lang":"es","title":"FileTools.eu — conversión de archivos gratuita que funciona","excerpt":"Una herramienta de conversión limpia sin anuncios molestos. PDF, imágenes, documentos — todo online sin registro.","category":"tools","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558494949-ef010cbdcc31?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Data center servers","publishedAt":"2026-03-19T08:00:00Z","readingTime":3},{"slug":"filetools-review-fr","lang":"fr","title":"FileTools.eu — conversion de fichiers gratuite qui fonctionne","excerpt":"Un outil de conversion propre sans publicités envahissantes. PDF, images, documents — tout en ligne sans inscription.","category":"tools","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1586953208270-767fc7370c0a?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Digital files and folders","publishedAt":"2026-03-19T08:00:00Z","readingTime":3},{"slug":"filetools-review-pl","lang":"pl","title":"FileTools.eu — darmowa konwersja plików, która działa","excerpt":"Przejrzyste narzędzie do konwersji bez nachalnych reklam. PDF, obrazy, dokumenty — online bez rejestracji.","category":"tools","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551288049-bebda4e38f71?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Analytics dashboard","publishedAt":"2026-03-19T08:00:00Z","readingTime":3},{"slug":"filetools-review-zh","lang":"zh","title":"FileTools.eu — 真正好用的免费在线文件转换","excerpt":"一个干净的文件转换工具，没有烦人的广告。PDF、图片、文档——在线无需注册。","category":"tools","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1460925895917-afdab827c52f?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Spreadsheet data on screen","publishedAt":"2026-03-19T08:00:00Z","readingTime":3},{"slug":"roomflip-review-cs","lang":"cs","title":"RoomFlip.io — AI návrh interiéru za pár korun","excerpt":"Nahrajte fotku pokoje a získejte AI návrhy přestavby během sekund. Více stylů od minimalismu po industrial.","category":"creative","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618221195710-dd6b41faaea6?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Minimalist bedroom design","publishedAt":"2026-03-19T08:00:00Z","readingTime":3},{"slug":"roomflip-review-de","lang":"de","title":"RoomFlip.io — KI-Innendesign zum kleinen Preis","excerpt":"Laden Sie ein Foto hoch und erhalten Sie KI-generierte Neugestaltungsvorschläge in Sekunden.","category":"creative","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600210492486-724fe5c67fb0?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Scandinavian style room","publishedAt":"2026-03-19T08:00:00Z","readingTime":3},{"slug":"roomflip-review-en","lang":"en","title":"RoomFlip.io — AI interior design on a budget","excerpt":"Upload a photo of your room and get AI-generated redesign suggestions in seconds. Multiple styles, from minimalist to industrial.","category":"creative","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1586023492125-27b2c045efd7?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Modern living room interior","publishedAt":"2026-03-19T08:00:00Z","readingTime":3},{"slug":"roomflip-review-es","lang":"es","title":"RoomFlip.io — diseño de interiores IA económico","excerpt":"Sube una foto y obtén sugerencias de rediseño IA en segundos.","category":"creative","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600607687939-ce8a6c25118c?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Contemporary kitchen interior","publishedAt":"2026-03-19T08:00:00Z","readingTime":3},{"slug":"roomflip-review-fr","lang":"fr","title":"RoomFlip.io — design d'intérieur IA à petit budget","excerpt":"Téléchargez une photo et obtenez des suggestions de redesign IA en quelques secondes.","category":"creative","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1616594039964-ae9021a400a0?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Elegant dining room","publishedAt":"2026-03-19T08:00:00Z","readingTime":3},{"slug":"roomflip-listicle-pl","lang":"pl","title":"5 pokoi, które możesz zmienić z RoomFlip w mniej niż 10 minut","excerpt":"Nie każde pomieszczenie nadaje się do wirtualnego remontu. Oto pięć, które wychodzą najlepiej.","category":"creative","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618221195710-dd6b41faaea6?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Jasny salon z nowoczesnym wystrojem wnętrz","publishedAt":"2026-03-19T09:00:00+01:00","readingTime":5},{"slug":"roomflip-review-pl","lang":"pl","title":"RoomFlip.io — AI projektowanie wnętrz w przystępnej cenie","excerpt":"Wgraj zdjęcie pokoju i otrzymaj propozycje przebudowy AI w kilka sekund.","category":"creative","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1615529328331-f8917597711f?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Home office workspace","publishedAt":"2026-03-19T08:00:00Z","readingTime":3},{"slug":"roomflip-review-zh","lang":"zh","title":"RoomFlip.io — 经济实惠的AI室内设计","excerpt":"上传房间照片，几秒内获得AI生成的重新设计建议。","category":"creative","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556909114-f6e7ad7d3136?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Japanese inspired room","publishedAt":"2026-03-19T08:00:00Z","readingTime":3},{"slug":"tubevoice-review-cs","lang":"cs","title":"TubeVoice recenze — AI dabing YouTube videí","excerpt":"Otestovali jsme TubeVoice, nástroj pro automatický překlad a dabing YouTube videí do 50+ jazyků. Tři úrovně kvality a překvapivě přirozené výsledky.","category":"ai","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1478737270239-2f02b77fc618?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Video editing studio setup","publishedAt":"2026-03-19T08:00:00Z","readingTime":3},{"slug":"tubevoice-review-de","lang":"de","title":"TubeVoice Test — KI-Synchronisation für YouTube-Videos","excerpt":"Wir haben TubeVoice getestet, ein KI-Tool zur Übersetzung und Synchronisation von YouTube-Videos in über 50 Sprachen.","category":"ai","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1598488035139-bdbb2231ce04?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Headphones on desk with screen","publishedAt":"2026-03-19T08:00:00Z","readingTime":3},{"slug":"tubevoice-review-en","lang":"en","title":"TubeVoice review — AI dubbing for YouTube videos","excerpt":"We tested TubeVoice, an AI tool that translates and dubs YouTube videos into 50+ languages. Three quality tiers, credit-based pricing, and surprisingly natural results.","category":"ai","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611162617474-5b21e879e113?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Microphone and audio waveform","publishedAt":"2026-03-19T08:00:00Z","readingTime":3},{"slug":"tubevoice-review-es","lang":"es","title":"TubeVoice reseña — doblaje IA para vídeos de YouTube","excerpt":"Probamos TubeVoice, una herramienta IA que traduce y dobla vídeos de YouTube a más de 50 idiomas.","category":"ai","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516280030429-27679b3dc9cf?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Multilingual subtitles on screen","publishedAt":"2026-03-19T08:00:00Z","readingTime":3},{"slug":"tubevoice-review-fr","lang":"fr","title":"TubeVoice avis — doublage IA pour vidéos YouTube","excerpt":"Nous avons testé TubeVoice, un outil IA qui traduit et double les vidéos YouTube dans plus de 50 langues.","category":"ai","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1505740420928-5e560c06d30e?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Headphones floating in purple light","publishedAt":"2026-03-19T08:00:00Z","readingTime":3},{"slug":"tubevoice-review-pl","lang":"pl","title":"TubeVoice recenzja — AI dubbing filmów z YouTube","excerpt":"Przetestowaliśmy TubeVoice, narzędzie AI do tłumaczenia i dubbingu filmów z YouTube na ponad 50 języków.","category":"ai","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1590602847861-f357a9332bbc?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Person recording podcast","publishedAt":"2026-03-19T08:00:00Z","readingTime":3},{"slug":"tubevoice-review-zh","lang":"zh","title":"TubeVoice评测 — YouTube视频AI配音工具","excerpt":"我们测试了TubeVoice，一款将YouTube视频翻译和配音成50多种语言的AI工具。","category":"ai","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1593078166039-c9878df5c520?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Sound mixing console","publishedAt":"2026-03-19T08:00:00Z","readingTime":3},{"slug":"tubevoice-grow-multilingual-cs","lang":"cs","title":"Jak rozjet vícejazyčný YouTube kanál s AI dabingem","excerpt":"Vaše videa už fungují. Teď je rozjeďte v dalších 7 jazycích — bez jediného nového nahrávání.","category":"ai","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611162617474-5b21e879e113?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"YouTube studio s vlajkami různých jazyků na obrazovce","publishedAt":"2026-03-19","readingTime":4},{"slug":"tubevoice-grow-multilingual-de","lang":"de","title":"So baust du einen mehrsprachigen YouTube-Kanal mit KI-Synchronisation auf","excerpt":"Deine Videos funktionieren bereits. Jetzt bring sie in 7 weitere Sprachen — ohne eine einzige neue Aufnahme.","category":"ai","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611162617474-5b21e879e113?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"YouTube-Studio mit mehreren Sprachflaggen auf dem Bildschirm","publishedAt":"2026-03-19","readingTime":4},{"slug":"tubevoice-grow-multilingual-en","lang":"en","title":"How to grow a multilingual YouTube channel with AI dubbing","excerpt":"Your videos already work. Now make them work in 7 more languages — without recording a single new voiceover.","category":"ai","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611162617474-5b21e879e113?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"YouTube studio with multiple language flags on screen","publishedAt":"2026-03-19","readingTime":4},{"slug":"tubevoice-grow-multilingual-es","lang":"es","title":"Cómo hacer crecer un canal de YouTube multilingüe con doblaje IA","excerpt":"Tus vídeos ya funcionan. Ahora haz que funcionen en 7 idiomas más — sin grabar ni una sola voz nueva.","category":"ai","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611162617474-5b21e879e113?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Estudio de YouTube con banderas de varios idiomas en pantalla","publishedAt":"2026-03-19","readingTime":4},{"slug":"tubevoice-grow-multilingual-fr","lang":"fr","title":"Comment développer une chaîne YouTube multilingue grâce au doublage IA","excerpt":"Vos vidéos marchent déjà. Faites-les marcher dans 7 langues de plus — sans enregistrer une seule nouvelle voix.","category":"ai","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611162617474-5b21e879e113?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Studio YouTube avec des drapeaux de différentes langues à l'écran","publishedAt":"2026-03-19","readingTime":4},{"slug":"tubevoice-grow-multilingual-pl","lang":"pl","title":"Jak rozwinąć wielojęzyczny kanał YouTube z dubbingiem AI","excerpt":"Twoje filmy już działają. Teraz spraw, żeby działały w 7 kolejnych językach — bez nagrywania ani jednego nowego lektora.","category":"ai","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611162617474-5b21e879e113?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Studio YouTube z flagami różnych języków na ekranie","publishedAt":"2026-03-19","readingTime":4},{"slug":"tubevoice-grow-multilingual-zh","lang":"zh","title":"如何用AI配音打造多语言YouTube频道","excerpt":"你的视频已经有效果了。现在让它们在另外7种语言中同样有效——不需要录制任何新的配音。","category":"ai","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611162617474-5b21e879e113?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"YouTube工作室屏幕上显示多国旗帜","publishedAt":"2026-03-19","readingTime":4},{"slug":"tubevoice-vergleich-de","lang":"de","title":"YouTube-Videos synchronisieren: Manuell vs. TubeVoice im Direktvergleich","excerpt":"Manuell synchronisieren dauert Stunden. TubeVoice braucht Minuten. Aber ist das Ergebnis auch brauchbar? Wir haben beides getestet.","category":"ai","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611532736597-de2d4265fba3?w=800&q=80","imageAlt":"Mikrofon vor einem Monitor mit Videobearbeitungssoftware","publishedAt":"2026-03-19","readingTime":4},{"slug":"filetools-guide-fr","lang":"fr","title":"FileTools : 5 conversions que vous faites mal (et comment les corriger)","excerpt":"Vous convertissez encore vos PDF en Word avec un site rempli de pubs ? Il y a mieux.","category":"tools","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1586281380349-632531db7ed4?w=1200&h=630&fit=crop","imageAlt":"Documents et fichiers numériques sur un bureau","publishedAt":"2025-03-19","readingTime":3}]}]}],["$Le"],"$Lf"]}]
